      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "https://significa.co/#website",
      "url": "https://significa.co/",
      "name": "Significa",
      "description": "Significa is a digital Product Design and Development agency turning complexity into clarity. From UX strategy to scalable code, we build with care.",
      "publisher": {
        "@id": "https://significa.co/#organization"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "https://significa.co/#webpage",
      "url": "https://significa.co/",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "name": "Significa",
      "isPartOf": {
        "@id": "https://significa.co/#website"
      },
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://significa.co/#organization"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why should I work with Significa?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Because you'll get a fully dedicated team, a tailor-made approach, and the quality you'd expect from an award-winning design agency. We treat your product like it's our own, designing it around real users, and building it to grow with your business. Still unsure if an agency is the right fit? We've written this article to help you decide."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is it like to collaborate with Significa?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It's open, structured, collaborative, and built on trust. We work as one team, using tools like Slack and Notion to keep communication flowing and ensure you're always in the loop, from progress updates to budget tracking and team allocation. This helps us stay aligned, avoid surprises, and deliver the best results from Discovery to Quality Assurance."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does a project take from start until launch?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on the project's size and complexity, but most take between 3 and 6 months from kick-off to launch. We break things down into phases, so there's always clarity on what's happening, what's next, and when it's due. If you're looking for quick wins or MVPs, we'll help define the most efficient path forward with cost and timeline estimates."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which projects do you usually take on?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We build design-led digital products, from custom e-commerce platforms, to web and mobile apps, and marketing websites built on scalable, custom design systems. Our projects often involve integrating complex inventory logics, managing platform migrations, and optimising digital products for usability, performance, and conversions. We often work directly with our client's internal teams, whether it's revising strategy and design, optimising content management systems, or building a new product from the ground up. Want to know more about how we design and build digital products? Check out our services for the full picture."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why do I need a design and development agency if I have AI?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "AI is a powerful tool, but it's not a replacement for strategy, creativity, emotion, or well-executed code. We use AI too, but we know that great products come from asking the right questions, understanding users, designing with purpose and making smart decisions. That's where we come in!"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What if I don't like the final results?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "That's very unlikely, because you're part of the design and development process the whole way through. We don't disappear into a black box and come back with a big reveal. Instead, we communicate openly, share early and often, continuously check in with you, and ensure there's time to iterate and refine as we go. If something's not right, we'll fix it together."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

