        }
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is Significa’s mission?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "To build the best digital products, and to enjoy the process while we’re at it. We combine design and development to create user-centred solutions that work seamlessly, look great, and help businesses grow. And we do it with care, clarity, and curiosity. No unnecessary features. No bloated processes. Just thoughtful work that solves the right problems."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What’s your team made of?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Designers, developers, product managers, and digital strategists who care about building great digital products — and being good teammates while we are at it. We’re kind, curious, and collaborative. We bring our decade-long experience, skills, ideas, and dry humour to the table, then work closely with startups and enterprises to create intuitive, scalable and beautiful user-centred digital products."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which industries or sectors do you usually work with?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We design and develop custom digital products for businesses across fashion, sports, fintech, health and wellness, beauty, and hospitality. From native app development to e-commerce platform design and marketing websites, our work adapts to each industry's specific challenges and user expectations. Most of our clients are international businesses looking to improve digital experiences, scale conversions, and future-proof their platforms for growth. Curious about how we bring these ideas to life? Take a look at our Services to learn more."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Significa a B Corp?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "That’s right! Our ambition to be one of the best design and development agencies in the world extends beyond the quality of our work; we strive to we meet the highest standards of social and environmental impact, doing business for good. Discover our B Corp certification journey in our 2024 impact report."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

